{
  "description": "Thirteen page shapes cover every route of the clone's real route table (src/route-modules/*.js, recorded in extraction/measured-values.json routeTable): landing, persona, not-found, pricing, download, awards, legal (including the awards terms), blog index, blog post, changelog, store index, store category and app detail. Long-form pages are decomposed (legal header + body, article cover + header + body + footer, one node per post card or release). Add a template by appending an entry here, section contracts under sections/, the allowlist, graph and schema (see README 'Adding a template').",
  "scope": {
    "built": [
      "/",
      "/app/:slug",
      "/aup",
      "/awards",
      "/awards/terms",
      "/blog",
      "/blog/:slug",
      "/changelog",
      "/creators",
      "/designers",
      "/download",
      "/engineers",
      "/pricing",
      "/privacy",
      "/product-managers",
      "/store",
      "/store/design",
      "/store/developer-tools",
      "/store/games-and-fun",
      "/store/lifestyle",
      "/store/media",
      "/store/productivity",
      "/store/remixable",
      "/store/utilities",
      "/teams",
      "/terms",
      "/* (404, includes /m)"
    ],
    "notModelled": "The in-page 'App not found' state of /app/<unknown slug> (no footer, not a separate route); search-result states (?q=, ?page=, ?entriesQuery=, ?entriesPage=) of /store, /store/:category and /awards."
  },
